name: sim.setObjectSpecialProperty
description: Deprecated. See properties instead
luaSynopsis: sim.setObjectSpecialProperty(int objectHandle, int prop)
pythonSynopsis: sim.setObjectSpecialProperty(int objectHandle, int prop)
inputs:
1. objectHandle: object handle
2. prop: object special property. See the object special property values. Combine them with the "or"-operator
outputs:
replacedBy:
- name: collidable, class: sceneObject, file: sceneObject_collidable.property
- name: measurable, class: sceneObject, file: sceneObject_measurable.property
- name: detectable, class: sceneObject, file: sceneObject_detectable.property
